Starting early in the morning, we will drive together as a group to the Fort Worth Nature Center, located about an hour from Denton. Once we arrive, we’ll unload our gear and begin exploring the area’s diverse landscapes. We’ll spend the day hiking through scenic trails as we experience the wildlife and natural beauty of this ecological island within the city. After our adventures, we’ll take a break to eat lunch (please bring your own meal), then pack up and head back to UNT by mid to late afternoon. 

